cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these designs in your research, please cite them using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Slide Templates: 3D-printable imageable area guides for spatial biology slides and tissue blocks"
abstract: >-
  3D-printable STL guides for marking the imageable areas of
  25 x 75 x 1 mm glass microscope slides used with the CosMx, GeoMx,
  Fusion, CellScape, Atera, Xenium, and Visium HD imaging platforms,
  and for visualizing imageable tissue regions in FFPE and fresh
  frozen (FF) tissue blocks. Designed in Tinkercad and tested on a
  Formlabs Form 3B+ with Black V4.1 resin.
authors:
